WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.269
-Former President Donald Trump
made his

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.871
first post presidency
public appearance

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.973
at the Conservative Political
Action Conference

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.207
this weekend,
where he and his fellow

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:10.810
Republicans continued to repeat
their deranged

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.945
lies about everything from COVID

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:14.881
to the 2020 election
to Mr. Potato Head.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.517
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:20.954 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:23.122
Now, the grotesque symbolism
of Trump's return

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:25.325
to the political spotlight
nearly a year

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:28.060
after the coronavirus
pandemic upended our lives

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.662
could not have been more stark.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.197
Remember, it was almost
exactly a year ago

00:00:32.197 --> 00:00:35.335
that Trump as President
was saying stuff like this.

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:37.003
-It's going to
disappear one day.

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:39.105
It's like a miracle
it will disappear.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:42.041
View this the same as the flu.
We're testing everybody

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:43.976
that we need to test.

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:46.379
And we're finding
very little problem.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:49.949
We're going to be pretty soon
at only five people

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.851
and we could be at just one
or two people

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.886
over the next short
period of time.

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:57.590
It's a little like the regular
flu that we have flu shots for.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.658
And we'll essentially have a flu
shot for this,

00:00:59.658 --> 00:01:03.029
in a fairly quick manner.
When you have 15 people

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.663
and the 15
within a couple of days

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:08.234
is going to be down
to close to zero.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.969
That's a pretty good job
we've done.

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.071
-Well, hats off.
A pretty good job, indeed.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:14.073
15 people going down to zero.

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:16.976
Look, I'm as critical
of the man as anyone,

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.277
but give credit
where credit's due.

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.580
The coronavirus was surging
throughout the world.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.081
But thanks
